<title>USA: All-Comm Media names Barbera chairman.</title>
<headline>All-Comm Media names Barbera chairman.</headline>
<dateline>CULVER CITY, Calif. 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>All-Comm Media Corp said it named Jeremy Barbera chairman and chief executive officer, replacing Barry Peters, who resigned earlier this month.</p>
<p>A spokesman for the company said Barbera will hold onto his current titles of president and chief operating officer until a successor is named, but said he did not know whether an active search was under way.</p>
</text>
